# Sonic Advance 2 (USA): language screen to the cartridge save (gate G7), made for tools/gba_fresh_process.py save.
# Frame 450 A (English), frame 700 A (enters one character on REG. NAME), frame 760 Start (END), frame 900 A (confirms):
# the game writes its 64 KB Flash save by about frame 1000. Run it for 1500 frames.
# frame,keyinput_active_low (the value holds until the next line)
0,0x03ff
450,0x03fe
454,0x03ff
700,0x03fe
704,0x03ff
760,0x03f7
764,0x03ff
900,0x03fe
904,0x03ff
